OL,3,GNEWSASalah's surprise reunion with
OL,4,Alittle Liverpool fan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young Liverpool fan living with a
OL,7,Frare genetic condition has been flown
OL,8,Fout to Turkey to meet his hero, Mohamed
OL,9,FSalah.
OL,11,FSalah's new club, Trabzonspor, and
OL,12,FTurkish Airlines flew eight-year-old
OL,13,FIsaac Kearney and his family there to
OL,14,Fsurprise the former Liverpool forward,
OL,15,Faccording to a post on Isaac's
OL,16,FInstagram account.
OL,18,FFootage published by the Turkish club
OL,19,Fshows Isaac - who has chromosone
OL,20,Fdisorder Wolf-Hirschhorn syndrome -
OL,21,Fapproaching Salah during training
OL,22,Fbefore they embrace.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
