OL,3,GNEWSASalah's surprise reunion with
OL,4,Alittle Liverpool fan
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsaac was also filmed meeting other
OL,7,FTrabzonspor players, including
OL,8,FManchester United goalkeeper Andre
OL,9,FOnana, who is on loan at the Turkish
OL,10,Fclub. A post on Isaac's Instagram
OL,11,Faccount said Onana gave him a pair of
OL,12,Fgloves.
